ected Snapshot/schema/changefeed paths. This remains the private Transactional implementation; it does not advertise or qualify the full profile.\n\nValidation: thirteen targeted source stages passed (18 selected cases), with the original two test-fixture failures and corrections retained. An emitted-gate negative control reproduced the prior named 500 failure. After ordinary integration with main, a fresh clean build and fourteen external-package validation stages passed: three callbacks, 92 HTTP observations, six closed child processes. Existing unknown-position and retained-Snapshot gaps remain explicit.\n\nDraft while exact-head CI and final Codex + Claude review complete. The initial full Claude invocation timed out without findings; focused protocol and test/evidence reviews replace that inconclusive attempt. No merge gate is waived.\n","created_at":"2026-10-15T23:19:23Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T23:19:23Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"6b4fc76d87d4f61e61cc973f4f2435300d87f435","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/pulls/137/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/pulls/137/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/issues/137/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gastownhall/bdp/statuses/c18c71202c90fa2558f34107ad342befabf750fe","head":{"label":"gastownhall:codex/vickie-minimum-receiving","ref":"codex/vickie-minimum-receiving","sha":"c18c71202c90fa2558f34107ad342befabf750fe","user":{"login":"gastownhall","id":255961667,"node_id":"O_kgDOD0GqQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/255961667?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gastownhall","html_url":"https://github.com/gastownhall","followers_url":"https: